# 构建产物 / build artifacts
#
# 逐个列名的坏处已经兑现过一次：/airlock-agent 在列表里，/airlock-gateway
# 不在，于是一个 12MB 的编译二进制被提交进了仓库并存活了很多次提交。
# Go 二进制会内嵌构建路径——那份产物里带着构建机的家目录。
# 现在按 cmd/ 下的目录名统配，新增命令不会再漏。
#
# Listing artifacts by name failed once already: /airlock-agent was listed and
# /airlock-gateway was not, so a 12MB compiled binary was committed and survived
# many commits. Go embeds the build path, so that artifact carried the build
# machine's home directory. Now matched by pattern so a new command cannot slip.
# scripts/build.sh 的输出目录。
#
# 不忽略它的后果不只是脏工作区：go build 的 -buildvcs 用 git status 判断
# 仓库是否干净，未跟踪的 dist/ 会让它把 vcs.modified 标成 true。实测 CI 上
# 干净检出构建出的 Advanced 二进制版本号带 +dirty，而 Core 没有——差别只是
# 构建顺序：Core 先构建时 dist/ 还是空目录（git 不报告空目录），
# 轮到 Advanced 时里面已经有文件了。
#
# 一个 release 产物自称 dirty，等于自己削弱了 provenance 里「来自这个提交」
# 那句话，而原因只是它把自己的输出放在了仓库里。
#
# go build's -buildvcs uses git status, so an untracked dist/ marks the binary
# vcs.modified=true. Measured on a clean CI checkout: Advanced carried +dirty
# while Core did not — the only difference being build order. A release
# artifact calling itself dirty undercuts its own provenance.
/dist/
/airlock
/airlock-agent
/airlock-gateway
/airlock-agent-advanced
/airlock-analyzer
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# 覆盖率报告 / coverage
coverage.out
coverage.html

# 本地密钥挂载点——绝不能提交
# Local secret mounts — must never be committed
/secrets/
*.pem
*.key

# 编辑器与系统 / editors and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Python 分析器
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
